      "form_guide": "",
      "comment": "STREET BAND (2) is building nicely this time in, missing by 0.8L last start over this track and trip. Cooper hopping on board now takes 2kgs off and the form out of his last start has worked out well. This looks to shape similarly and he can strike third-up into the preparation. LINCHPIN (5) landed midfield and closed off strongly to miss out as the race favourite. Out to 1400m now is a big tick and the inside draw should see him much closer in the run. Looks set to raise the bar. BONDI'S FUTURE (3) had trialled well coming in off a very long 910-day break and didn't show any signs of ring rust, leading and only being gunned down late. Drawn wider this time, but he's likely to be better for that effort and he can't be left out of calculations. SOLDIER OF GOD (9) disappointed last start when getting well back and never featuring. Out in trip now and a better draw can see him in the finish.",
